 "name_en": "Letter of Credit Management – Group Ledger IFRS (49E)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Letter of Credit Management – Group Ledger IFRS (49E)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe04bb734d9a145f5b0ba416342bc8a09\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe04bb734d9a145f5b0ba416342bc8a09__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">By activating parallel valuation for letter of credit management, you can use another valuation area in addition to your operational valuation area per International Financial Reporting Standards (IFRS 9) phase I (Classification and Measurement).</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe04bb734d9a145f5b0ba416342bc8a09__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Post flows to general ledger</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform key date valuation</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe04bb734d9a145f5b0ba416342bc8a09__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Generate all postings for the general ledger</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Update the general ledger per IFRS 9 phase I (Classification and Measurement)</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>信用证管理 – 集团分类账 IFRS (49E)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe04bb734d9a145f5b0ba416342bc8a09\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe04bb734d9a145f5b0ba416342bc8a09__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过激活信用证管理的并行评估，您可以根据国际财务报告标准 (IFRS 9) 阶段 I（分类和度量）使用除运营评估范围以外的其他评估范围。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe04bb734d9a145f5b0ba416342bc8a09__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将流过账到总账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行关键日期评估</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe04bb734d9a145f5b0ba416342bc8a09__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">生成总账的所有过账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据 IFRS 9 阶段 I（分类和度量）更新总账</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
